1
00:00:00,162 --> 00:00:03,162
(Sheldon:)Oh, that's a rather earthy cologne.

2
00:00:05,934 --> 00:00:08,384
(Sheldon:)My uncle used to wear that.

3
00:00:09,137 --> 00:00:12,547
(Sheldon:)Perhaps we can enjoy one last meal
together before Leonard returns.

4
00:00:12,707 --> 00:00:14,777
(Penny:)Yeah, thanks, but I kind of feel
like eating alone tonight, so--

5
00:00:14,943 --> 00:00:18,653
(Sheldon:)Are you sure? With your Italian pizza
and my Chinese noodles,

6
00:00:18,814 --> 00:00:20,294
(Sheldon:)we could play Marco Polo.

7
00:00:20,448 --> 00:00:23,158
(Sheldon:)I mean, of course,
a reenactment of a meal

8
00:00:23,318 --> 00:00:25,728
(Sheldon:)in the life of Marco Polo
the Venetian explorer,

9
00:00:25,887 --> 00:00:29,167
(Sheldon:)not Marco Polo
the terrifying water sport.

10
00:00:30,492 --> 00:00:32,532
(Penny:)Uh, yeah. It sounds fun,
but no thanks.

11
00:00:32,694 --> 00:00:33,574
(Penny:)Have a good night!

12
00:00:33,728 --> 00:00:37,078
(Sheldon:)-What, now, do you have company?
-No. No, no, no.

13
00:00:37,232 --> 00:00:38,732
(Penny:)You know what?
The toilet's been doing that.

14
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:41,350
-l called the building manager, so--
-Oh, I can take a look at it.

15
00:00:41,503 --> 00:00:44,073
(Scene:)-Well--
-I'm quite familiar with plumbing.

16
00:00:44,239 --> 00:00:48,309
(Sheldon:)Not to brag, but I spent most of
fifth grade with my head in a toilet.

17
00:00:48,476 --> 00:00:51,186
(Penny:)Yeah, no, no, no.
You know what, Sheldon, it's okay.

18
00:00:51,346 --> 00:00:53,016
(Penny:)You don't have to go
into the bathroom.

19
00:00:53,181 --> 00:00:55,921
(Sheldon:)That's curious.
If there's no one here,

20
00:00:56,084 --> 00:00:59,194
(Sheldon:)why are there two glasses
of wine on the table?

